Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来只需要这么做...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪亮药水就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:16.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:20.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 马上就能见到健康的爸爸和妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:22.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:25.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我去告诉小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便帮我把汤药带过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:29.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:34.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:37.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:41.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小...小晴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:44.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:48.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:52.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉！吵醒你了...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 真白 受你们照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我也说说 发生什么好事情了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:11.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能够治疗国王和王妃的闪亮药水 已经做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.23,0:01:17.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这样大家就可以一起回去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:19.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好了！出发去蓝天大地！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1120,965)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}闪耀最亮星☆ 小空的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长！你没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 你干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:25.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不单单是靠我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是靠大伙齐心协力！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 从深邃的黑暗中醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是... 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像一直彷徨在某个地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:58.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.15,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 你没事就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两位中了虚蜢达的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前一直陷入深眠之中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经不用再担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:22.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然已经会说话了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再叫一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:36.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主... 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,还得是爸爸妈妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:43.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 一家人团团圆圆是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王和王妃从深眠中醒来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这些孩子们...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了Precure的奋斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热闹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 都是怎么写的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:12.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,解开了国王和王妃的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:18.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,并且拯救了蓝色护卫队飒拉拉队长的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:23.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害了！我们是不是成有名人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我刚才给父母打了电话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:29.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也激动得很夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴的家人肯定也很喜悦的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:33.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:40.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,终于能让爸爸妈妈也放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止呢 整个蓝天大地举国欢庆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民众想见一见Precure的呼声是愈发强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:53.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:55.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好难为情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在决定 在广场举办一场巡游
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是凯旋而归的胜利大巡游啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 由蓝色护卫队开道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家就请乘着那些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:09.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那些孩子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈... 好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:20.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我能骑上去吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的 在蓝天大地连小孩子都能骑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:25.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:29.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我来！小蝶姐姐先来骑骑看！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真温柔呢 谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.04,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绕一圈吧 蝶华姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:45.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,距离巡游还有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,练习一下吧 真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 窍门在于...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:56.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咻咦 嘶 啦嗒嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:06:59.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像听不懂...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这种感觉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:05.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咻咦 嘶 啦嗒嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:07.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来很简单的样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:33.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,驭 一不留神都跑到这里来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学有成功骑上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飒拉拉队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微聊聊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用多休养一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵... 你以为我是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:53.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,名不虚传呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 你成长的速度很快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,"别停下脚步 英雄少女"！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:07.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在我踌躇不前的时候 是队长的这句话在背后推动我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 改变了你的 不仅仅是我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:23.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与朋友的邂逅 能开阔世界 能让你认识到全新的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:39.62,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这画的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不正是我和王妃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.35,0:08:49.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画得可太棒了 小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:08:59.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,卟卟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卟卟？是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这画的是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:07.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是由由博士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:15.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空的家！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里也是公主的家啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,这这！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 小公主 这里的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,天空环境！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,天来接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:42.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,海扩天空 光之美少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:54.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那时候相同的光...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.40,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:22.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这里也有炸面包球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:25.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦 是面包炸球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,包面炸球？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是面包炸球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:32.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啥球...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了 先吃为敬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我开动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:44.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 和平时吃的炸面包有点不同...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.55,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对我来说 就是普通的炸面球啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不同世界的区别啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:11:00.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴和阿翼 与我和小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:05.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,外表看起来没有区别 却是实实在在的不同世界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:11.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛就是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有着像是从画书里奔出来的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:20.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是能乘神奇的大鸟 还是吃到奇妙的炸面包
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,以及与大家的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:28.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,希望这奇迹能够永远长久...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王和王妃找你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇敢的Precure们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无数次得到你们的救助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们救了公主 解开了我们的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由心地感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的十分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:55.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一件事... 很重要的事 不知你们能否接受？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着这孩子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你们 再一次带着公主回到你们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:19.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要让公主去天窗市？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:23.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易才又见到爸爸和妈妈的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也想和可爱的小公主一直相伴...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 她可是“命运之子”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:31.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:32.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,命运？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在大约1年前...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 今天的天空特别美...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 确实是非常漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟 最亮星都已经...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(905,965)}长庚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:13:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哎哟喂...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个小宝宝究竟是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是命运之子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定能拯救蓝天大地于毁灭的危难之中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毁灭... 我们国家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们亲手养育她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另有预言 在不远的未来 她将踏上旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在时机到来之前 请你们照料她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是养父母
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们作为父母的时候 可能只是一瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此还愿意的话 请握住她的手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要是拒绝的话 她会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会去寻找其他的适合人选
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 让我也抱抱她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是多么的可爱 又是多么的幼小
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 犹如在遥远夜空中闪耀的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安心吧 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.19,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.35,0:14:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空... 就给她取名天空吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:48.57,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天开始 这里就是你的家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是你的爸爸妈妈哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:14:59.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空是从天而降的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 小公主又迸发出了命运的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们心有不舍 但这是她将踏上旅途的信号吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想和你在这里一起生活的... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:23.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,摸摸 摸摸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:32.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不哭 不哭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖 乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经是个温柔的孩子了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 肯定没有问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使离开了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也有着能保护你的 温暖的家和家人们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.51,0:16:02.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,家人...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝国肯定会继续向蓝天大地 和你们那边派出刺客
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不住啊 要让你们背负危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还请你们一定要保护天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:33.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下 王妃殿下...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:38.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我将一如既往 保护好小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会负责的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们了 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 我们给你们开道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:54.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 这次是最后一次陪着你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要与你无可替代的伙伴们 一同走你们自己的英雄之路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:05.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:08.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:15.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我不拿着 也能够再见到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我会保护蓝天大地的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.71,0:17:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论何时 都将是你们坚强的后盾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:28.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,驭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.46,0:17:36.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 挺溜的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:38.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:45.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌 是恶作剧云
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:47.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:50.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是指在大晴天的时候 偏偏出现一朵黑云
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在蓝天大地被叫做恶作剧云
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的庆贺给糟蹋了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.48,0:18:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 难得有一个晴朗的好日子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:06.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做点什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:11.27,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我想让小空见到蓝天大地的万里晴空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:12.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:14.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:16.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
