Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.11,0:21:12.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,金彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主 待命运转过一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要回爸爸妈妈这里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里等你 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:28.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:30.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:35.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在同一片蓝天下 我们的相遇或许是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:41.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,由命运所系 我们像家人一起 生活在当下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:45.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在 真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:47.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅仅是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:50.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还有未来...啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谱写这段历史 开辟新的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将来一定会...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
