Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:52.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喔喔~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:53.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,斑马
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:54.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,兮兮~
